363
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:10,640
life-threatening
causes, and it's also

364
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:13,240
important to make sure
we get things right.

365
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:15,960
So make a good differential.

366
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,600
Your life-threatening
causes that you want to

367
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,100
