diagnosis was important.

383
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:04,840
When I was a resident, we
got a call from EMS. It came

384
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:07,440
in as alert. The patient
was in septic shock and

385
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:10,620
