about a six-year-old male.

394
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,380
He was alert. He was
oriented, but he was

395
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:38,800
hypotensive. And he was
complaining of feeling dizzy,

396
00:20:38,940 --> 00:20:42,820
