a malaise type feeling.

397
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,900
And he knew his blood
pressure was low

398
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,940
because he even had
taken it at home.

399
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:49,820
He said earlier in
that morning, he

400
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:52,140
