and nausea has anaphylaxis.

461
00:24:10,470 --> 00:24:13,000
Again, in this case, they
had a suspected allergen

462
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:15,680
and they have the wheezing
and nausea. They meet the

463
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:18,240
