testing, but hypotension

477
00:24:54,140 --> 00:24:56,360
within minutes, hours after
an exposure to a known

478
00:24:56,360 --> 00:24:58,320
allergen. In that case, we
had to suspect that was the

479
00:24:58,320 --> 00:25:00,760
allergen because it was the
only thing different that

480
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:05,920
he did. And all the other
differential diagnoses were

481
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:08,040
getting ruled out as we
were treating this patient.

482
00:25:09,220 --> 00:25:12,020
When we talk about
anaphylaxis, when the patient

483
00:25:12,020 --> 00:25:14,770
meets the criteria for
anaphylaxis, but it

484
00:25:14,770 --> 00:25:18,020
involves hypotension,
they are actually also

